Subject: [PATCH] [daveey] kanban cap headroom: Hub route wrappers into
 kanban_sync_hub_routes, create flag parsers into kanban_cli_flags

Pure moves, no behavior change. kanban_sync_client.py was 2002 (> 2000 FILE_LINES) after the rebase onto
db8b5c1168; kanban.py sat at 1999 (main now 2000). Hub now inherits leases/repin/recover/reserve/machines/report_pickup from
HubRoutesMixin (sessions and report_metrics keep their own error/budget handling in kanban_sync_client), and
kanban.py imports _parse_workspace_flag/_parse_branch_flag from kanban_cli_flags under the old names.
kanban_sync_client.py 1974, kanban.py 1968 (after rebase onto bb57afa2f8).
